
cff-version: 1.2.0

message: >-
  If you use these MATLAB scripts in your research,
  please cite this software and the associated research article.

title: >-
  Analytical MATLAB Codes for Fine Structure,
  Rotational Hyperfine Splitting, and Superradiant
  Widths in Myers-Perry-AdS

authors:
  - given-names: "Hamed"
    family-names: "Ramezani"

type: software

abstract: >-
  MATLAB scripts for evaluating analytical expressions
  describing massive scalar quasibound states around
  small, singly spinning Myers-Perry-AdS black holes.
  The scripts reproduce effective-potential diagrams,
  fine and rotational hyperfine spectral splittings,
  and horizon-induced damping and superradiant growth
  rates. They do not implement an independent numerical
  quasibound-state eigensolver.

keywords:
  - Myers-Perry-AdS
  - Gravitational atom
  - Massive scalar field
  - Fine structure
  - Rotational hyperfine splitting
  - Superradiance
  - MATLAB

